# 30. SQL INJECTION AND OWASP TOP 10

SQL Injection belongs to:

> **OWASP A05 – Injection**

The Injection category can include different injection types, such as:

- SQL injection
- Command injection
- LDAP injection
- NoSQL injection
- Other interpreter-related injection problems

### Memory

> **A05 = Input becomes something the interpreter didn't intend.**

